msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perché?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fe1d018ece6aa04367556fe1930534f7617515eb4c93f8e817a5e8db4585999
#. default-sha256: 6184a56a71c11e1f3bbcf3d0b5f510a5bc84bc50b5412e538eb6967726717c58
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫was to go back to the way things used to be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tutto ciò che volevo... ⟪k:1⟫era che le cose tornassero come un tempo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8239288c50ee12ae04f0a309f5c62d3f375c5c86a4a0fe5fcd25f8455cfd9cf8
#. default-sha256: 14292f115a276da0f78fe12b5ea8cd9ffcee437de700b8e474d80b0da5ba8a23
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for us... ⟪k:1⟫to be able to smile around each other..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫in modo... ⟪k:1⟫che potessimo sorriderci nuovamente..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfdc9e07370c115e875a8f422ad60499125f36a31949de38aba1d3e9839473b2
#. default-sha256: 774c64b88642dfcb921a83e306ed7510b13f59e174137c07cea41f1a59200000
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It had been several days since Jacopo had locked her in the shed,⟪k:5⟫"
"and her day-to-day life was only growing more arduous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Erano passati diversi giorni da quando Jacopo l’aveva rinchiusa nel "
"capanno, e la sua vita diventava ogni giorno più ardua."

#: scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcfedf4de76f0798e629a313d306b9831cfa79137eb2c8863edc2d22de0ea056
#. default-sha256: 49ae4b7deecc90c95c62a350eb8983ea8f4605d289439823db4d34a360eb7497
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was under constant surveillance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era costantemente sorvegliata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87afcd082ee2696162e3829c4898b7743938c0b60617a9874d9afd7b21c95fed
#. default-sha256: 08b0256178e3d21361c01118ac20db18aa03cae0a453991a456bdd69388cc7be
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door was only unlocked to deliver her meals, three times a day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La porta veniva aperta solo per consegnarle i pasti, tre volte al giorno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55803af976e8b8c21b4045517876cec2f6f6782943ffbbae423d6eee10be6f55
#. default-sha256: a7c29edea457450aa29546e87691ecdeceefd99109ab52f0e47b4a2c226afeda
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And despite what an unfortunate situation their employer’s wife found herself in, the maids "
"chattered and gossiped and giggled freely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E nonostante la sfortunata situazione in cui si trovava la moglie del loro datore di lavoro, "
"le domestiche chiacchieravano, spettegolavano,⟪k:1⟫e ridacchiavano senza scrupoli."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 865b26b7a48714c2e3540560e537861064c9623e0eeeafe879a2bf546683d54a
#. default-sha256: ed1ebacdabe6526e82f7748158a9cefe5fcbcb8dabc1dcb14e249a869b44b980
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not even in the shadows, out of her presence—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the tactless young maidservants "
"whispered directly to the White-Haired Girl when they brought her meals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E non di nascosto, fuori dalla sua presenza—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫le sussurravano in modo diretto, senza "
"tatto, quando le portavano da mangiare."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58907e74a8118dbb327e5b8a274d86a27f664f413951c727e7610fc9693a8feb
#. default-sha256: 975680d1dacd27aa112d75dd32528942c4107dc8b980c996208dffe1be54ccfe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Look at you, Madam. Caged away like cattle.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Guardatevi, Madam. Rinchiusa come il bestiame.”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc8bd82015fe73b2f3c13eebc15176968d80411b568e7ca416f039a7d34be7e3
#. default-sha256: 57856a2d3ba3abc9bcb52140f071fd7c33c51cee2f1ad0ab1859599806b5839f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could almost hear the sound of cracks forming in her heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Potevo quasi sentire il rumore delle crepe che si formavano nel suo cuore."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e38b4de81907667d87995b29807949a4c1633e622abaf92b8582ae325039a06
#. default-sha256: 7e01ac720cb2316aeac2eb25a20ff0d1a1dd99f086d7bdf0819e8b2f3bafd969
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine she had gotten to the point where she was having difficulty merely holding herself "
"together. ⟪k:1⟫She had done nothing wrong, and yet she was forced to live this life of insults "
"and mockery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Immagino che fosse arrivata al punto da non riuscire più a reggere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non aveva fatto "
"nulla di male, eppure era costretta a condurre una vita piena di offese e affronti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a22cfeb181e8a4331d1e7abdc8011805206690a73495ddfd6e29ab0057b9960
#. default-sha256: cd9d7236621654416bc2adf7172aafbf35b5ce276616c711bc9c0739cd20a458
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of ridicule."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Una vita di insulti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef2cea7973d83c57c58fe51411bb8b6dadc964e862296b9c81d9a13ee5446009
#. default-sha256: 04f6948282ce5dd84d72c865233a19aa7393e5d2c7538252e3b23061fe55b20e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The only reason her tenuously held together spirit did not completely shatter was because "
"she still had her one and only ally."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’unica ragione che impediva al suo spirito di infrangersi completamente, era la presenza di "
"un’amica—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫la sua unica, sola alleata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e134850e69d19f3a2ccf7327e56121f1846a52e78ba17832ee8c36ea06ddee3b
#. default-sha256: e006c03f11f6fa30dff32147d55ddf828d67b0f114842ba83d1457ceef828dde
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maid Maria volunteered to attend to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La domestica Maria si offrì volontaria per occuparsi della Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ef1eaef7f83bbe52f1fdb06d019b618f4d4111f27ffd663639ddc77e0631ae4
#. default-sha256: fb1c8fb0b5488e76427675a5ea7e8d06a14a2479a39d4a8fd5392008eb3ec40d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria took over the duty of delivering her three meals, meaning the other maids stopped "
"coming by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si assunse il compito di consegnarle ognuno dei tre pasti, il che significa che le altre "
"servitrici smisero di entrare nella sua nuova stanza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00c6024630d8723a30f6ec03cf067995f73fcea8f81eccd5f48da32453b4bbd0
#. default-sha256: 183dbb862609b75ecf0ef261fa1848f310769afe658ca225f41aedc19b02d0a9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that relieved the White-Haired Girl’s mental and emotional stress considerably."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E questo risollevò considerevolmente l’umore della ragazza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cee299efa74799a681d5a2f21918a0e4fbf3c0c8b1cfbb89a7c8d000cf8d5e1
#. default-sha256: e3037258506e91ea222b7a99bcd9170e4e38948c4c26812113bb3c9c44f56e42
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria became her sole conversation partner, her sole companion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not leave "
"as soon as meals were finished, instead remaining in the shed with the White-Haired Girl for some "
"time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria era l’unica persona con cui potesse parlare, la sua unica amica.⟪k:1⟫ Non se ne andava "
"appena consegnati i pasti; rimaneva nel capanno a farle compagnia per diverso tempo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BCFD5ACC_E8B5_4165_9D19_82B98BCB3AEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d51ff7361133cb76cb212921f731582913c26d235052faaa1698edeaf296db14
